SUMMARY:FMEA Professional Development Conference 2027
LOCATION:Tampa Convention Center 333 S Franklin St Tampa \, FL 33602 Unite
 d States
DESCRIPTION:For event details: www.fmea.org (http:www.fmea.org) or (800) 3
 01-3632 The FMEA Professional Development Conference is one of the largest
  music education professional development events in the United States. In 
 addition to approximately 250 clinic sessions and concerts\, it is host to
  22 All-State Ensembles featuring Floridas top Band\, Orchestra\, Chorus\,
  Guitar\, and Elementary Orff students conducted by world-class conductors
  and teachers. It is attended by more than 10\,000 people\, including seco
 ndary music directors\, elementary music teachers\, music supervisors\, co
 llege students\, college music teachers\, school administrators\, K-12 stu
 dents performing in the All-State ensembles\, students and professional mu
 sicians performing with invited performing ensembles\, exhibitors\, and pa
 rents of performing students. The FMEA Professional Development Conference
  is one of the largest music education professional development events in 
 the United States. In addition to approximately 250 clinic sessions and co
 ncerts\, it is host to 22 All-State Ensembles featuring Floridas top Band\
 , Orchestra\, Chorus\, Guitar\, and Elementary students conducted by world
 -class conductors and teachers. It is attended by more than 10\,000 people
 \, including secondary music directors\, elementary music teachers\, music
  supervisors\, college students\, college music teachers\, school administ
 rators\, K-12 students performing in the All-State ensembles\, students an
 d professional musicians performing with invited performing ensembles\, ex
 hibitors\, and parents of performing students. Tickets for the All-State P
 erformances will be available at registration on a first come first serve 
 basis. For more information\, please call (800) 301-3621 or visit www.flmu
 siced.org (http:www.flmusiced.org) Location: Tampa Convention Center Entir
 e Convention Center \n\nPermalink: https://www.tampa.gov/node/193041
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.tampa.gov/node/193041
